OL,3,GNEWSAUnion secures #15k towards unpaid
OL,4,APride performer fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trade union representing some of the
OL,7,Fperformers left unpaid after the
OL,8,Fcharity running Manchester Pride went
OL,9,Finto administration said it has managed
OL,10,Fto secure #15,000.
OL,12,FEquity said the money came from
OL,13,Fcontributions from businesses within
OL,14,Fthe "social action pot" put forward by
OL,15,FManchester City Council.
OL,17,FIt comes amid an ongoing Charity
OL,18,FCommission investigation into the
OL,19,Forganisation which previously ran the
OL,20,Fevent.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
