OL,3,GNEWSAUnion secures #15k towards unpaid
OL,4,APride performer fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FEquity member and LGBTQ+ theatre-maker
OL,7,Fand activist Nathaniel Hall said it was
OL,8,F"encouraging" news and, while the money
OL,9,Fwould not cover all the losses, "the
OL,10,Fgesture is really welcome".
